:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[DONALD MORDEN (Enemy)]].''
'''DONALD MORDEN''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] of [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] grants [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] targeting.

